			"notes": "First release of Create: All the Soup as You Go for Minecraft 1.21.1.\n\n- Drain soups with Create's Item Drain and fill bowls with the Spout.\n- Support all four Minecraft soups and nine soups and broths from Farmer's Delight 1.3.4.\n- Give every soup its own animated fluid texture and bucket.\n- Keep suspicious stew effects through draining, filling, tank storage and buckets.\n- Add buckets to creative search and Tools & Utilities.\n- Include English and Spanish (Spain) names and a new soup logo.\n\nTested with NeoForge 21.1.251, Create 6.0.10, Farmer's Delight 1.3.4 and Jade 15.10.6."
